## Macro Name: nz-create-from-template-advanced
## Macro Title: Create from Template (advanced)
## Description: Button to create a new page from a specific template on a specific location with an automatic incremental numeric identifier or current date.
## Categories: Confluence content, Formatting, Navigation, Visuals & images
## Macro Body Processing: No
##
## Author: MvB - https://nerdzone.nl
## Credits: -
## Date: 2019-07-25
## Version: v1.0.12

## Variable type helpers
#set ($Integer = 0)

## @param ButtonText:title=Button Text|type=string|required=false|default=New page|option-showNameInPlaceholder=false|option-showValueInPlaceholder=true|desc=Change the text on the button to something descriptive.

## @param TemplateID:title=Template|type=string|required=false|option-showNameInPlaceholder=false|option-showValueInPlaceholder=false|desc=Identifier number from the template to use (use next toggle and refresh as a helper).
## @param ShowSpaceTemplates:title=Show Space Templates|type=boolean|default=false|option-showNameInPlaceholder=false|option-showValueInPlaceholder=false|desc=Enable this and refresh the preview on the right to reveal all Space Template and ID's as a helper to fill in the previous field.

## @param ParentPage:title=Parent page|type=confluence-content|required=false|option-showNameInPlaceholder=false|option-showValueInPlaceholder=false|desc=Select a page where to create the page (default=current page). Note: Only pages in the current space are supported.

## @param UseCurrentDate:title=Use current date as title|type=boolean|default=false|option-showNameInPlaceholder=false|option-showValueInPlaceholder=false|desc=Use the current date (YYYY-MM-DD) as title. When checked, the next three fields are of no value.

## @param ItemPrefix:title=Prefix|type=string|required=false|option-showNameInPlaceholder=false|option-showValueInPlaceholder=false|desc=Define the prefix, e.g. ACTION- (see documentation).
## @param PaddingDigits:title=Number of digits for zero-padding|required=false|default=3|option-showNameInPlaceholder=false|option-showValueInPlaceholder=false|desc=This formats the number with leading zeros. With a number of digits = 3, the serials will be 001,002,etc.
## @param StartNumber:title=Starting number|type=int|default=1|required=false|option-showNameInPlaceholder=false|option-showValueInPlaceholder=false

## @param ButtonColor:title=Button Color|type=enum|enumValues=Grey,nz-pink,nz-blue,nz-sky,nz-horizon,nz-summer,nz-evening,nz-clay,nz-ice,nz-green|default=Grey|option-showNameInPlaceholder=false|option-showValueInPlaceholder=false
## @param ButtonSize:title=Button size|type=enum|enumValues=Small,Medium|default=Medium|option-showNameInPlaceholder=false|option-showValueInPlaceholder=false
## TODO: icon parameter
## ## @param ShowAddIcon:title=Show add-icon (+)|type=boolean|default=true|option-showNameInPlaceholder=false|option-showValueInPlaceholder=false
## TODO: open in external window
## ## @param OpenExternal:title=Open in new window|type=boolean|default=false|option-showNameInPlaceholder=false|option-showValueInPlaceholder=false

#### TemplateID-helper - this is apparently the only way to get ID's from space-templates, as an enumValue-list cannot be a parameter. Refresh the preview to get the results, copy the id, deselect this value and continue...
#if ($paramShowSpaceTemplates == true)
<hr>
#set ($spaceTemplates = $space.getPageTemplates())
#foreach ($spaceTemplate in $spaceTemplates)
  $spaceTemplate.getTitle() -- $spaceTemplate.getContentTemplateId() <br>
#end
<hr>
#end

#### Style the button - this is a specific colorset, but can be changed as needed
#set ($theTextColor = "255, 255, 255")
#if ($paramButtonColor == "nz-pink")
  #set ($theButtonColor = "227, 5, 111")
#elseif ($paramButtonColor == "nz-blue")
  #set ($theButtonColor = "4, 55, 117")
#elseif ($paramButtonColor == "nz-sky")
  #set ($theButtonColor = "0, 170, 231")
#elseif ($paramButtonColor == "nz-horizon")
  #set ($theButtonColor = "117, 192, 67")
#elseif ($paramButtonColor == "nz-summer")
  #set ($theButtonColor = "247, 149, 61")
#elseif ($paramButtonColor == "nz-evening")
  #set ($theButtonColor = "73, 38, 131")
#elseif ($paramButtonColor == "nz-clay")
  #set ($theButtonColor = "195, 130, 90")
#elseif ($paramButtonColor == "nz-ice")
  #set ($theButtonColor = "200, 217, 223")
  #set ($theTextColor = "100, 108, 111")
#elseif ($paramButtonColor == "nz-green")
  #set ($theButtonColor = "57,135,12")
#else
  #set ($theButtonColor = "127, 127, 127")
#end
<style>
a.lui-button-$paramButtonColor, a.lui-button-$paramButtonColor:focus, a.lui-button-$paramButtonColor:link, a.lui-button-$paramButtonColor:visited, a.lui-button-$paramButtonColor:active {
  background-color: rgba($theButtonColor, 0.60);
  color: rgba($theTextColor, 1.00);
#if ($paramButtonSize == "Small")
  font-size: 8pt;
  height: 20px;
  line-height: 14px !important;
  padding: 2px 10px;
#end
}
a.lui-button-$paramButtonColor:hover {
  background-color: rgba($theButtonColor, 1.00);
  color: rgba($theTextColor, 1.00);
#if ($paramButtonSize == "Small")
  font-size: 8pt;
  height: 20px;
  line-height: 14px !important;
  padding: 2px 10px;
#end
}
</style>

